00:28:27.509 --> 00:28:28.509
Ms. Katha.

470
00:28:29.761 --> 00:28:30.885
Ms. Katha.

471
00:28:37.885 --> 00:28:38.885
Ms. Katha.

472
00:28:41.301 --> 00:28:42.469
Ms. Katha.

473
00:28:46.677 --> 00:28:47.841
Ms. Katha.

474
